{"2763830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Folk Tales: Alageyik", "steam_appid": 2763830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras/4a926527fe9835aae8be6894744989aa.avif?t=1770328042\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras_big/4a926527fe9835aae8be6894744989aa.avif?t=1770328042 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Folk Tales: Alageyik</i> tells a dark story inspired by Turkish myths. A hunter who has lost his family shoots a deer during a hunt at sunset. In that moment, darkness takes shape and Erlik appears. This encounter drags him into a night full of nightmares. When he awakens, the Ala Geyik stands before him—calling him to a journey where he must face his past, the loss of his family, and the darkness within himself. The story unfolds as a personal reckoning, where dream and reality intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras/8701dbcd30dfcbfc5b2a55636616f351.avif?t=1770328042\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras_big/8701dbcd30dfcbfc5b2a55636616f351.avif?t=1770328042 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erlik is the ruler of the underworld in Turkic mythology. Once a being tasked with creation, he was punished for defying God. Now, he is the lord of death and darkness; he commands decayed souls and stands as a symbol of forgotten justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras/9064fefa18728fa8667c7e1dd7fc820a.avif?t=1770328042\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras_big/9064fefa18728fa8667c7e1dd7fc820a.avif?t=1770328042 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alageyik is a silhouette that appears in the night; neither fully real nor entirely imagined. In Turkish folk tales, it is known as a sacred, mysterious, and untouchable being. In the game, pursuing it is not just a hunt—it is a confrontation with darkness, the past, and destiny.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras/4a926527fe9835aae8be6894744989aa.avif?t=1770328042\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras_big/4a926527fe9835aae8be6894744989aa.avif?t=1770328042 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Folk Tales: Alageyik</i> tells a dark story inspired by Turkish myths. A hunter who has lost his family shoots a deer during a hunt at sunset. In that moment, darkness takes shape and Erlik appears. This encounter drags him into a night full of nightmares. When he awakens, the Ala Geyik stands before him—calling him to a journey where he must face his past, the loss of his family, and the darkness within himself. The story unfolds as a personal reckoning, where dream and reality intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras/8701dbcd30dfcbfc5b2a55636616f351.avif?t=1770328042\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras_big/8701dbcd30dfcbfc5b2a55636616f351.avif?t=1770328042 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erlik is the ruler of the underworld in Turkic mythology. Once a being tasked with creation, he was punished for defying God. Now, he is the lord of death and darkness; he commands decayed souls and stands as a symbol of forgotten justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras/9064fefa18728fa8667c7e1dd7fc820a.avif?t=1770328042\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/extras_big/9064fefa18728fa8667c7e1dd7fc820a.avif?t=1770328042 width=1560 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alageyik is a silhouette that appears in the night; neither fully real nor entirely imagined. In Turkish folk tales, it is known as a sacred, mysterious, and untouchable being. In the game, pursuing it is not just a hunt—it is a confrontation with darkness, the past, and destiny.</p>", "short_description": "Folk Tales: Alageyik is an action-horror game inspired by Turkish myths. A hunter who has lost his family encounters Erlik and the mystery of the Alageyik during a deer hunt. Trapped between reality and dream, he must face death, regret, and his past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Greek<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/header.jpg?t=1770328042", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/147ca5149080783c73556878499cc1d46817e5fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770328042", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763830/147ca5149080783c73556878499cc1d46817e5fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770328042", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><stron